48. What is difference between static import and dynamic includes?
--- Static import is processed at playbook parsing time, while dynamic include is processed at runtime and supports conditions and loops.

49. What is serial keyword in playbook?
--- serial controls how many hosts run at a time. Used for rolling updates / zero downtime deployment

50. What is difference between push and pull configuration management?
--- ansible-pull -U https://github.com/repo.git site.yml

51. Why loop doesn't work with import_tasks?
--- Import happens before execution, Loop runs during execution , So import cannot use runtime data

52. When to Use Pull Model?
-- 1000+ servers (scaling issue), Nodes behind NAT/firewall , Continuous compliance needed

53. Explain commands pull model of ansible ?                         
